[{"form_id":"0x000874|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"わかったよ!俺がなんとかするから、頼むから放っておいてくれ!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000874|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"自分の役目を果たせ。これが最後の警告だ。"},{"form_id":"0x000800|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"町に雑貨屋はある？"},{"form_id":"0x000801|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"物資を探してるなら、リフテンに行くことを勧めるよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000801|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"町に雑貨屋はあるか?"},{"form_id":"0x000804|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"町にとっては大変だろう"},{"form_id":"0x000805|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"だが勘違いするな…俺たちの血には石が流れてるんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000805|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ、少なくとも自分にはそう言い聞かせてるがな。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000805|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"町にとっては辛いことだろうね。"},{"form_id":"0x000808|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"もともとショールズ・ストーンの出身なのか?"},{"form_id":"0x000809|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ダークウォーター・クロッシングに行ったことある？ あんなに美しい場所なのに、ひどい名前よね。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000809|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"両親があそこに住んでるの。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x000809|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"もともとショールズ・ストーンの出身？"},{"form_id":"0x00080B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"レッドベリー鉱山で働いているの？"},{"form_id":"0x00080C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、そうだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"スカイリム一の鉱夫が目の前にいるぞ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00080C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"誰よりも速く岩を砕ける自信がある。お前よりもな。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x00080C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"レッドベリー鉱山で働いてるの?"},{"form_id":"0x00080E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あの忌々しいクモどもを鉱山から追い出せるなら、何だってくれてやる！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、その目つきはわかってるぞ。心配するな、噛みつきやしない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000810|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"鉱山の仕事は楽しいか？"},{"form_id":"0x000811|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"今じゃ採掘が俺の人生だ。他のことなんてやりたくない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000811|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"鉱山での仕事はどう？"},{"form_id":"0x000812|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"ずっと鉱夫だったのか?"},{"form_id":"0x000813|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そりゃ、昔は兵士だったさ…でも岩を砕くのに比べりゃ、子どもの遊びみたいなもんだった。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000813|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"ずっと鉱夫だったのか？"},{"form_id":"0x000814|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"冒険をしてみたら? 挑戦を楽しめるかもしれないよ。"},{"form_id":"0x000815|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それができるからって、俺より偉いとでも思ってるのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000815|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"自分がタフだと思ってるのか？ スカイリムをうろつくなんて、坑道を這い回るのに比べりゃピクニックみたいなもんだ！","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000815|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"本当の仕事はこういう場所で行われるんだ。血と汗が世界を回してるのさ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x000815|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"冒険をしてみたらどう？ やりがいを感じるかもしれないよ。"},{"form_id":"0x000816|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"家が壊れた後、グログマーが引き取ってくれてよかったね。"},{"form_id":"0x000817|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"確かにそうだ。いや、そうだった、か。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000817|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"家が壊されたあと、グログマーが引き取ってくれてよかったね。"},{"form_id":"0x000818|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"あまり確信がなさそうだな"},{"form_id":"0x000875|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"グログマーとの暮らしが楽だとでも?あの人の暮らしぶりを見ましたか?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000875|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"これでこの散らかりようを片付けなきゃならない。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000875|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"あまり確信がなさそうだね。"},{"form_id":"0x000819|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"グログマーと話せばいいだけだ。"},{"form_id":"0x00081A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もちろん！ よくわかったよ。俺たちを部屋に入れてくれれば、話は全部俺がする。心配無用だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ふん。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00081A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"グログマーと話せばいい。"},{"form_id":"0x00081D|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"内戦をどう思う？"},{"form_id":"0x00081E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この内戦は皆に打撃を与えてる。鉱夫は一番ひどくやられてる連中だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"内戦をどう思う？"},{"form_id":"0x000821|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ショールズ・ストーンへようこそ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000824|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"鉱山にクモがはびこっている?"},{"form_id":"0x00082D|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うちは閉まってる。さあ、行った行った。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082D|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"鉱山にクモが巣食っているのか？"},{"form_id":"0x000826|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"ここに来られてよかった。"},{"form_id":"0x000823|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"わざわざこんなところまで会いに来てくれたの？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000823|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"旅には慣れてるんでしょうね。この辺じゃ見ない顔だもの。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000823|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"ここに来られてよかった。"},{"form_id":"0x000828|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"ショールズストーンには訪問者が多い？"},{"form_id":"0x000825|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"できるだけお客さんを迎えるようにしてるけど、最近は旅人が少ないの。戦争のせいで、みんな道を避けてるのよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000825|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"ここには訪問者が多いの?"},{"form_id":"0x00082A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"鉱山のクモは片付けた。"},{"form_id":"0x00082B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ハッ！ あのクモどもに思い知らせてやったな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よくやった。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00082B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"鉱山のクモは片付けた。"},{"form_id":"0x00082E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"なぜ衛兵は鉱山を片付けていないんだ？"},{"form_id":"0x000830|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"戦争のせいで、ただでさえ人手が足りないんだ。こんなことに時間を割ける者はいない。嫌な話だが、それが現実だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000830|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"なぜ衛兵は鉱山を掃討しないんだ？"},{"form_id":"0x00082F|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"フィルンヤーに蜘蛛退治を頼まれたんだ。"},{"form_id":"0x000831|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いいか、衛兵の大軍より自分の方がうまくやれると思うなら、好きにするといい。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000831|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"フィルニャールにクモの退治を頼まれた。"},{"form_id":"0x000832|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"彼を追い出すべきだ。"},{"form_id":"0x000833|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"待て。お前…お前、本気か?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000833|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"無理だ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000833|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"彼を追い出すべきだよ。"},{"form_id":"0x000835|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ほら。迷惑をかけたお詫びに、このロックスプリンターを持っていくといい。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000836|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"鉱山が再開して、ショールズストーンはもう安全だ。"},{"form_id":"0x000837|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それで何かが変わるわけじゃない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000837|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"俺はつるはしを握れるようになってからずっと岩を砕いてきた。その俺が言うんだ、この鉱山は枯れかけてる。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000837|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"鉱山が再開して、ショールズ・ストーンはもう安全だ。"},{"form_id":"0x000838|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"アネッケとヴェルナーがよろしくと言っていた。"},{"form_id":"0x000839|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"両親は元気にしていたかしら?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000839|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"アネクとヴァーナーがよろしくと言っていた"},{"form_id":"0x00083A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"みんな元気にしてるよ"},{"form_id":"0x00083B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ダークウォーター・クロッシングまで行ってくれて、本当に助かったわ。ありがとう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"元気にしているよ。"},{"form_id":"0x00083D|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"雑用なんて青二才のやることだ。"},{"form_id":"0x00083E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ハッ!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"次の戦いでも勝利がお前と共にあるように、友よ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00083E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"雑用なんて青二才のやることだ。"},{"form_id":"0x00083F|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"なぜだめなんだ？"},{"form_id":"0x000840|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何の話だ?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000840|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"だから人付き合いは避けてるんだ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000840|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"俺は鉱石を掘らなきゃならん。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x000840|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"いいじゃないか"},{"form_id":"0x000841|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"なるほど。彼がいなくなると寂しいんだね。"},{"form_id":"0x000842|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そうかもな…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000842|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"鉱山の恵みは多かったが、それを分かち合う伴侶がいない。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000842|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"なるほど。彼がいなくなると寂しいんだね。"},{"form_id":"0x000843|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"二人は妙な組み合わせだな。"},{"form_id":"0x000844|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ここにいる者は皆、血を分けた仲間だ。一つの家族、一つの部族だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000844|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"俺は自分の時間を大事にしてる。だから、いいか?","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000844|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"二人は変わった組み合わせだね。"},{"form_id":"0x000847|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"グログマーとの暮らしがそんなに悪いはずはない。"},{"form_id":"0x000848|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"冗談でしょう?この有様を見てください。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000848|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ここはどんどんひどくなる一方ですよ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000848|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"グログマーとの暮らしもそこまで悪くないだろう。"},{"form_id":"0x000849|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"何か手伝おうか?"},{"form_id":"0x00084A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お願いです、このままにしておかないでください。みっともないったらない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00084A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"何か手伝えることはある？"},{"form_id":"0x00084B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"グログマーと話してみる。"},{"form_id":"0x00084C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ありがとう。どうか急いでくださいね。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00084C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"グログマーと話してみる。"},{"form_id":"0x00084D|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"何でもない"},{"form_id":"0x00084E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"わかりました、それでは。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00084E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"何でもない。"},{"form_id":"0x000850|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"オドフェルが家事を分担してほしいそうだ。"},{"form_id":"0x000851|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ちっ。わかったよ、さっさと済ませよう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000851|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"無理だ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000851|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"俺は古い伝統を固く守ってる。名誉、強さ、行いだ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x000851|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"家の掃除なんて女の仕事をするくらいなら、鉱山で鉄を運び上げてる方がいい。","index":4},{"form_id":"0x000851|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"オドフェルは家事を分担してほしいそうだ。"},{"form_id":"0x00081B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"オドフェルは家事を分担してほしいそうだ。"},{"form_id":"0x000852|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"一緒に暮らすなら家事も分担しないと。(説得)"},{"form_id":"0x000853|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"わかった、わかった。お前に言いくるめられたよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000853|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"一緒に暮らすなら家事も分担しないと。(説得)"},{"form_id":"0x000854|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うーむ…よし…これでどうだ?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000855|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"話し合いで解決できないかな? (<BribeCost>ゴールド)"},{"form_id":"0x000856|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もちろんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000856|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"少しの金があれば、物事は円滑に進むもんだ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000856|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"話し合いで解決できないかな？ (<BribeCost> ゴールド)"},{"form_id":"0x000857|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"金が足りないぞ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000858|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"何でもない"},{"form_id":"0x000859|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いいだろう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000859|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"何でもない。"},{"form_id":"0x00085A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"あなたの代わりにオドフェルと話をつけようか?"},{"form_id":"0x00085B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、そうだろうとも!役立たずのよそ者が手を貸しさえすれば、マラキャスが俺たちを憐れんでくださるってわけだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00085B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"わかりました、それでは。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00085B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前がそう望むなら。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x00085B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"オドフェルとの件、代わりに何とかしてみようか？"},{"form_id":"0x00085F|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"グログマーについて話がある"},{"form_id":"0x000860|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何でしょう?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000860|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"グログマーのことで話がある。"},{"form_id":"0x000861|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"彼の不始末は受け入れてやったらどうだ。(説得)"},{"form_id":"0x000865|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、なるほど。わかりました。やりましょう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000865|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"彼の散らかしは受け入れたらどうかな。 (説得)"},{"form_id":"0x000866|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なんと無礼な!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000866|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"話はこれで終わりのようですね。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000862|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"何でもない"},{"form_id":"0x000867|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"わかりました、それでは。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000867|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"何でもない。"},{"form_id":"0x000863|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"グログマーは確かに強そうだ。でも私のほうが強い。手を引け。(威圧)"},{"form_id":"0x000868|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"乱暴はやめてください!あなたの勝ちです。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000868|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"言ってくれればよかったのに。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000869|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"自分がタフだと思ってるのか？ スカイリムをうろつくなんて、坑道を這い回るのに比べりゃピクニックみたいなもんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000864|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"金だ。衛兵を雇って掃除を手伝わせたら？ (<BribeCost>ゴールド)"},{"form_id":"0x00086A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ありがとうございます。有効に使わせてもらいますよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"少し金を出そう。衛兵を雇って掃除を手伝ってもらったらどうだ？ (<BribeCost> ゴールド)"},{"form_id":"0x00086B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"財布の中身が思ったより軽いようですね。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086D|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"オドフェルと話した。もう雑用のことであなたを煩わせないそうだ"},{"form_id":"0x000871|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"素晴らしい!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000871|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ありがとう。ほら、これをやる。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000871|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"オドフェルと話した。もう雑用のことで文句は言わないはずだ。"},{"form_id":"0x00086F|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"グログマーと話した。雑用を手伝ってくれるそうだ"},{"form_id":"0x000870|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ご親切に感謝します。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000870|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"グログマーと話した。雑用を手伝ってくれるそうだ。"},{"form_id":"0x000872|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"礼儀ってものを教えてやろうか (喧嘩)"},{"form_id":"0x000873|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"その言葉、拳で証明する覚悟はあるんだろうな!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000873|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"礼儀を教えてやろうか。(喧嘩)"},{"form_id":"0x000879|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"ゲイル湖の釣りはどう？"},{"form_id":"0x00087A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"冗談だろ?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"毎朝出かけてるんだ。それなのにまったく食いつかない!石から血を絞り出そうとしてるようなもんだ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00087D|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あなたもハイ・フロスガーへ向かう巡礼者ね。私なら、この時代遅れの小さな町はさっさと通り過ぎるわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000880|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"巡礼者か、それともただの通りすがりか?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000881|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"バッシアヌスについて教えてくれ"},{"form_id":"0x000882|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"彼って本当に素敵なの。私、彼を愛してると思う!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000882|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"でも彼はリフテンに移りたいって。それに、お父さんは何でも大げさに騒ぎ立てるし。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000884|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"修道院へ登るところだ"},{"form_id":"0x000887|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ハイ・フロスガーへ向かうなら、道中は気をつけることだ。石段にはオオカミがうろついているそうだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000887|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それに、できるだけ早く町を出ることだな。ここには誰にとっても何もない。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000886|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ、できるだけ早く町を出ることだな。ここには誰にとっても何もない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000889|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"イヴァルステッドについて何か知ってる？"},{"form_id":"0x00088A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"昔はそこそこ大きな町だったんだが、しばらく前から皆リフテンに移っていってな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この町には歴史がたくさんあるんだ。だが見回してみろ。ほとんど何も残っちゃいない。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00088B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"どうかした?"},{"form_id":"0x00088C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"夢見がちな娘の目を覚まさせる方法を何か知らないか?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"す…すまない。娘のことが心配でな。ファストレッドには頭がおかしくなりそうだ。だから少々気が立っていても許してくれ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000901|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ファストレッドがあの…あのろくでなしとリフテンへ駆け落ちしたなんて信じられん。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088F|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あの子はバシアヌスに恋してると思い込んでるが、子供ってのはわかるだろう。気まぐれは月と一緒にころころ変わる。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088F|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ほんの数ヶ月前は、クリメクに夢中だったんだ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00088F|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"とてもついていけないよ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x000890|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"彼女と話してこようか？"},{"form_id":"0x000891|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いや、いや。あの子はまだ子供だ。そのうち治まるさ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000892|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"子供は手がかかるものだ。"},{"form_id":"0x000893|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"その通り。もし身を固めて子供を持つことがあれば、よく考えてからにしろよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000896|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"山に気をつけろ!山に食われるぞ!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000896|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、レイダ!レイダ!お前は今、雲の上で暮らしているんだね、愛しいレイダ!","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000899|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"レイダ!レイダーー!レイダ!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00089A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"レイダ!レイダーー!レイダを見なかったか?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00089B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"いや、悪いけど。<Alias=Player>だ"},{"form_id":"0x00089D|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"見えないよ、レイダ!見つからない!どうして隠れるんだ?隠れて、隠れて、隠れて、隠れて!悲しませないでくれ!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00089C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"レイダとは誰だ？"},{"form_id":"0x00089E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"見えないよ、レイダ!見つからない!どうして隠れるんだ?隠れて、隠れて、隠れて、隠れて!悲しませないでくれ!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A0|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"宿屋の主人か?"},{"form_id":"0x0008A1|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いらっしゃい、友よ!ヴァイルマイヤー宿屋へようこそ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A1|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"部屋が要るかい?それとも一杯やるか?何か欲しいものがあれば、遠慮なく言ってくれ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008A1|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"で、ハイ・フロスガーに登るんだろう?","index":3},{"form_id":"0x0008A2|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"どうして分かったんだ?"},{"form_id":"0x0008A4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"修道院へ登る人でもなけりゃ、ここを訪れる客はあまりいないんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ハイ・フロスガーへ登るなら、足元に気をつけな…落ちたら下まで長いぞ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008A4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、ここにいる間は、町の東側の墓地には近づかない方がいい…幽霊が出るんだ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x0008A3|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"実はしばらくここに滞在しようと思っていたんだ。"},{"form_id":"0x0008A5|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もちろん。さっきも言ったが、何か要るなら言ってくれ。それとも暖炉のそばに座ってくれれば、誰かを行かせるよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A5|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、ここにいる間は、町の東側の墓地には近づかない方がいい…幽霊が出るんだ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008A7|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"ミードの出来はどう?"},{"form_id":"0x0008A8|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ブラック・ブライアの蜂蜜酒に勝るものはない。実は、それがうちの自慢でね。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A8|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ、戦争中でも積荷が届けばの話だがな。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008A8|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"最高の蜂蜜酒はリフテン産なんだぜ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x00091F|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そうさ。あんたのおかげでな。しかもスカイリム最高の蜂蜜酒だ!一杯どうだい?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00091F|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"ブラック・ブライアのハチミツ酒は十分にある?"},{"form_id":"0x0008A9|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"実は、マーラ聖堂の任務で来ているんだ。"},{"form_id":"0x0008AA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"マーラ聖堂だって?それならちょうどいい所に来た!ぜひうちに泊まっていってくれ。光栄だよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008AA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"修道院へ登る人でもなけりゃ、ここを訪れる客はあまりいないんだ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008AA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、ここにいる間は、町の東側の墓地には近づかない方がいい…幽霊が出るんだ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x0008AC|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"何か言いたそうだね。"},{"form_id":"0x0008AD|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"失礼、旦那様。音楽はいかが?私のリュートを聴いてみませんか?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008AE|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"失礼、お嬢様。音楽はいかが?私のリュートを聴いてみませんか?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B0|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"何か歌ってもらえる？"},{"form_id":"0x0008B1|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いいえ、ごめんなさい。私はリュートを弾くだけなの。何か聴いていく?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"信じられる?また丸太の山が台無しよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"忌々しいクマどものせいで頭がおかしくなりそう!","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008B6|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"製材所の様子はどう?"},{"form_id":"0x0008B8|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いいからどいて、仕事があるの。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もらった毛皮は有効に使わせてもらうわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"機会があったら、またクマを何頭か仕留めてくれない?","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008B9|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"本当にそんなにひどいの?"},{"form_id":"0x0008B7|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"製材所をやるにはスカイリムで最悪の場所よ。あんなにクマがうろついてて、どうやって仕事をしろっていうの?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B7|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"誓って言うけど、あと一つでも何かがうまくいかなかったら、製材所ごと燃やしてやるわ!","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008BC|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"グレイビアードをどう思う？"},{"form_id":"0x0008BD|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あの人たちが私たちに何をしてくれたっていうの?それなのに、私たちは自分たちの食料をグレイビアードに届けてきたのよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BF|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"魔法についてもっと学べる場所を知ってる?"},{"form_id":"0x0008C0|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ノルドは魔法をあまり好まないの。見下されないのはウィンターホールドの大学くらいね。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C0|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それ以外なら、リフテンの宮廷魔術師に話してみるといいわ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008C0|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"彼女の評判がよくないのは知ってるけど、なんといっても宮廷魔術師だもの。魔法については誰よりも詳しいわ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x0008C2|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"製材所での仕事について教えてくれ。"},{"form_id":"0x0008C3|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ええ。世界一刺激的な場所ではありませんが、私は幸せですよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C3|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO RNAM","string":"製材所で働いているの？"},{"form_id":"0x0008C4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あのクマたちのせいで、テンバさんはすごく怒っているんです。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"でも、こう言っては何ですが、あの人は口が悪いだけで根は優しいんですよ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008C5|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あなたがクマを片付けてくれたので、テンバさんはずっと機嫌がいいんです。そうは見えないかもしれませんが、私にはわかります。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C6|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"テンバはよくしてくれる？"},{"form_id":"0x0008C7|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"テンバさんは少し短気ですが、人生には短気なんかよりもっと心配すべきことがたくさんありますよ、友よ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"新しい人が町に来るのってすごくわくわくする!何か面白い話はない?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CB|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"通りかかっただけだ"},{"form_id":"0x0008CC|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あちこち旅して回るのって、どんなにわくわくするんだろう。あなたって本当に幸運ね!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CC|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"私も一緒に行けたらいいのに…","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008CD|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"グレイビアードに会いにハイフロスガーへ登るところだ"},{"form_id":"0x0008CE|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ!旅人さんね!この退屈な町の外の世界について、話したいことがたくさんあるでしょう!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CE|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"私も一緒に行けたらいいのに…","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008D0|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"疲れているようだね"},{"form_id":"0x0008D1|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"7000階段を登るのは骨が折れる。残念ながら、私の脚も昔のようにはいかなくてね。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D1|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まずは少し休もうかな。日を改めて行くとしよう。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008D1|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"7000階段とはね…次はもっと地面の近くに建ててほしいもんだ…","index":3},{"form_id":"0x0008D3|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"7000階段で気をつけることはある？"},{"form_id":"0x0008D4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ、たまにオオカミの群れやはぐれ者が出るくらいで、私が相手にしたのはそれだけだ。あなたほどの人なら問題ないだろう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それ以外は、足元に気をつけることだ。この冬の天候じゃ、階段は危ないからね。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008D7|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やあ、友よ。ハイ・フロスガーへ向かう途中かい?私もちょうど上へ配達に行くところなんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D9|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"イヴァルステッドについて何か知ってる？"},{"form_id":"0x0008DA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なんて退屈な話題だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008DA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"巡礼者には見えないな。なんでわざわざアイバーステッドなんかに?","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008DA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なんて退屈な町だ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x0008DC|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"ちょっといいかな？"},{"form_id":"0x0008DD|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ん?今どうしても俺の邪魔をしなきゃならないのか?何の用だ?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008DF|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"シビと話した"},{"form_id":"0x0008E0|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あの人殺しの野蛮人と話してたの?そんな!私の居場所を教えたのね。殺されちゃう!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E1|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"彼はあなたがモロウウィンドに逃げたと思っている"},{"form_id":"0x0008E3|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"私の居場所を教えなかったの?信じられないわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E3|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それにウィルヘルム…彼はとても親切にしてくれたわ。どこか別の場所を探さなきゃいけないと思ってたのに。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008E3|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ご親切にありがとう。あなたには借りができたわ。いいえ、命の恩人よ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x0008E2|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"彼はあなたがここにいることを知っている"},{"form_id":"0x0008E4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"知らせてくれてありがとう、旦那様。でも、これからどうしたらいいのかわからないわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E5|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"知らせてくれてありがとう、お嬢様。でも、これからどうしたらいいのかわからないわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E7|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この先どうしたらいいのか、もうよくわからないの。東へ、モロウウィンドとの国境の方へ行ってもいいかもしれない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E9|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"町の東側にある墓地について教えてくれないか？"},{"form_id":"0x0008EA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"私の忠告を聞いて。あの呪われた場所には近づかないで。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"言い伝えがあるの…私も最初は信じてなかったけど。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008EA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"でも墓地のそばにいた時…私…見た気がするの。あの…幽霊を!","index":3},{"form_id":"0x0008EB|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"そこで何をしていた？"},{"form_id":"0x0008EC|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"興味はあったわ。でも、幽霊だらけの古代の墓になんて足を踏み入れるもんですか!何を考えてたのかしら?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EC|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"誓うわ、もう二度とあそこには行かない。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008ED|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"ミードをもらう (20ゴールド)"},{"form_id":"0x0008EE|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よし。ほら、どうぞ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EF|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ちょっと持ち合わせが足りないようだな。金ができたらまた来てくれ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F0|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"また今度。"},{"form_id":"0x0008F1|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もちろん。他に何か買いたいものはあるかい?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F3|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"クマがいそうな場所を知らない？"},{"form_id":"0x0008F4|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"クマはそこら中にいますよ。周りを探してみてください、近くに小さな洞窟がきっと見つかるはずです。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F6|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"クリメクをどう思う？"},{"form_id":"0x0008F7|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"クリメク?そうね…実はけっこうハンサムだと思わない?でも彼、釣りのことしか頭にないの。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F9|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"ファストレッドについて教えてくれ"},{"form_id":"0x0008FA|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もちろん、素敵なお嬢さんさ。それにな、できることなら明日にでもここから彼女をさらっていきたいところだが、クリメクはまだまだ学ぶことが多いな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FC|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"ファストレッドをどう思う？"},{"form_id":"0x0008FD|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、ファストレッドか。何があったのかよくわからないんだ。さっきまで私に微笑んでいたかと思えば、次の瞬間には目も合わせてくれない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FD|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"バシアヌスなら何が起きているかわかるだろう。彼は女性のことをよくわかっているから。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x0008FF|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"リフテンは気に入っているか？"},{"form_id":"0x000900|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"すごくわくわくする!まるでおとぎ話みたい!","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000902|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"彼女とバッシアヌスはリフテンに引っ越したの?"},{"form_id":"0x000903|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ファストレッドがいなくなったなんて信じられん。俺は…もっとあの子に優しくしてやるべきだった。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000905|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"農場での暮らしはどう？"},{"form_id":"0x000906|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"農場の仕事は報われないものよ。でも、私たちはここでの暮らしが好きなの。生まれてからずっとここにいるわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000908|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"娘さんの具合はどう?"},{"form_id":"0x000909|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ファストレッドがリフテンで元気にやっているといいけど。娘には幸せになってほしいの。ただ、寂しくてね。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00090A|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"彼女はリフテンに?"},{"form_id":"0x00090B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あの子は世界を見たいだけなのよ…私もあの子の年頃はそうだったわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00090B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それにバシアヌスは、何のためらいもなくファストレッドをリフテンへ連れていった。あの子が面倒に巻き込まれていないといいけど。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00090E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ストームクロークが何と言おうと知ったことじゃない。帝国が何と言おうと知ったことじゃない。あのひどいサルモールが何と言おうとね。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00090E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"戦争で国は引き裂かれて、今度はドラゴンの噂まで!おまけにこの馬鹿なクマどものせいで、こっちはやっと食いつないでる有様よ!","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00090E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"スカイリムはまったく先が見えないわ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x000911|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"聞いた話じゃ、この内戦でスカイリムはかなり疲弊してるらしい。少なくとも、まだここまでは来てないがな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000912|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"どちらの側を支持してる？"},{"form_id":"0x000913|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"残念だが、ウルフリックもエリシフもあまり好きじゃないんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000913|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"だが、ここは平和な村だ。政治とは無縁でね。俺としてはこのままであってほしいよ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000913|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"心配いらない。戦争でどっちを支持していようと、ここでは皆歓迎だ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x000915|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"グウィリンについて教えてくれ"},{"form_id":"0x000916|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"はあ。あいにく、うちの弟子は指図されるのが嫌いでね。いい仕事ってのはなかなか手に入らないものよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000918|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"7000段の階段について教えてくれないか？"},{"form_id":"0x000919|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あそこで過ごすのが好きなんだ。階段を歩いて、碑文について瞑想する。実に穏やかなものだよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000919|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"だが、ハイ・フロスガーへの道を登るなら、オオカミには気をつけろよ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000919|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それと用心しろ、落ちたら下まで長いぞ。","index":3},{"form_id":"0x00091B|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"イヴァルステッドのことをどう思う？"},{"form_id":"0x00091C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"世界のノドの陰で暮らしながら、生まれてからずっとこの辺りで狩りをしてきた。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00091C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それだけあれば十分だ。単純なことさ。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00091D|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"最近、荷は届いた?"},{"form_id":"0x00091E|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ、いや。甘いハニングブリューを味わったことはあるかい?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000922|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"湖での釣りは忙しい？"},{"form_id":"0x000923|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"忙しいの意味によるね。一人で食べるんじゃ、魚なんて何の役に立つ?","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000802|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"QUST FULL","string":"More to Say 会話 ショール・ストーン"},{"form_id":"0x000845|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"QUST FULL","string":"おかしな二人"},{"form_id":"0x000876|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"QUST FULL","string":"More to Say 会話 カイネスグローブ"},{"form_id":"0x000877|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"QUST FULL","string":"More to Say 会話 イヴァルステッド"},{"form_id":"0x00085D|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"QUST FULL","string":"More to Say 会話 ダークウォーター・クロッシング"},{"form_id":"0x00085C|moretosayshorsstone.esp","type":"QUST FULL","string":"More to Say 会話 ハートウッド製材所"}]